  "description": "Telegram OpenID Connect sign-in for ASP.NET Core. Wires cookie authentication and the authorization-code + PKCE flow against oauth.telegram.org, and hands the host two hooks: a gate that decides who may sign in and with which claims, and an optional audit sink. Works around Telegram's 256-char state limit and its unsolicited gzip responses. Server-side only: Telegram does not support public OIDC clients.",
